{"id":8833356955847,"title":"Custom Tree of Life Quilt Set Celtic Yggdrasil Bedding","handle":"custom-tree-of-life-quilt-set-yggdrasil-bedding-97b4844050-97b4844050","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the symbolic beauty of the Tree of Life with this custom quilt set by Jeminise. Perfect for nature lovers, this versatile farmhouse-style quilt offers lightweight warmth in the summer and cozy comfort during winter, making it an ideal choice for year-round indoor or outdoor use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize every aspect of this quilt, including the background, framing color, and text saying squares to feature your own words or names.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoft \u0026amp; Cozy Comfort:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made from 100% soft polyester with high-quality silk floss filling, providing a breathable and durable sleeping experience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Multi-functional design works perfectly as a bed quilt, picnic mat, throw blanket, or cozy wrap for camping and backyard lounging.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An excellent present for men, women, moms, dads, or special occasions like Christmas, Valentine's, Mother's, and Father's Day.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Choose from various sizes including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable and quickly dries, designed to resist pilling, fading, and wrinkling for low-maintenance care.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e